   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "General rule: person before thing",
     "texto": [
      "In German we say **Ich schenke meinem Bruder eine Uhr** (I give my brother a watch) or **Der Vater gibt dem Kind einen Apfel**. The recipient (**Wem?** / to whom?) in the dative precedes the object transferred (**Was?** / what?) in the accusative."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Common double-object verbs",
     "texto": [
      "This structure is typical of verbs of transfer and communication: **geben** (to give), **schenken** (to give as a gift), **schicken** (to send), **zeigen** (to show), **bringen** (to bring)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
